\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Le Cam probe honesty: gradient-boosted AUC against confounding strength $g$ at matched configurations, split by aspect ratio. At $c=0.8$ the probe remains at chance through $g=0.8$ and turns informative only near $g=1.6$; at $c=0.2$ the self-standardized $\|b\|^2$ signature is readable immediately (AUC up to $1.0$). The frozen universal-invisibility rule fails as a universal statement and is rescoped by $c$.}}{19}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:lecam}{{4}{19}{Le Cam probe honesty: gradient-boosted AUC against confounding strength $g$ at matched configurations, split by aspect ratio. At $c=0.8$ the probe remains at chance through $g=0.8$ and turns informative only near $g=1.6$; at $c=0.2$ the self-standardized $\|b\|^2$ signature is readable immediately (AUC up to $1.0$). The frozen universal-invisibility rule fails as a universal statement and is rescoped by $c$}{figure.4}{}}
